WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV v3.0 — rce-vc (15s) Narrator River

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.689
First, many people and AI agents write at once,

2
00:00:03.689 --> 00:00:07.212
and a named check admits changes or records why.

3
00:00:07.572 --> 00:00:11.336
Second, tracking name-free functions instead of text lines

4
00:00:11.336 --> 00:00:15.230
lets unrelated edits pass together without false merge wars.

5
00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:22.952
Third, developers stay on ordinary Git while checking against one hundred thousand items takes seventy microseconds.
